: Calculate the tangent of an angle:<br />Given:<ul><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/Delta.gif" alt="&delta;" />&nbsp; <em>$A$B$C</em><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$A</em>=90<sup>o</sup><br /><li> <em>$A$B=$AB</em> and <em>$A$C=$AC</em></ul><p />Calculate the tangent of <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$C</em>
: The correct answer is: $AB &divide; $AC <br /><small>(or approximately ... $G)</small>
: Calculate the angle , using the tangent.<br />Given:<ul><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/Delta.gif" alt="&delta;" />&nbsp;<em> $A$B$C</em><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$A=90</em><sup>o</sup><br /><li> <em>$A$B=$AB</em> and <em>$A$C=$AC</em></ul><p />Calculate the size of <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$C</em><br /> at two decimals accurately
: The correct answer is: $hoek<sup>o</sup>
: Calculate the length of a side , using the tangent.<br />Given<ul><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/Delta.gif" alt="&delta;" />&nbsp; <em>$A$B$C</em><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$A</em>=90<sup>o</sup><br /><li> <em>$A$C=$AC</em> and <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$C</em>=$hoek<sup>o</sup></ul><p />Calculate the length of side <em>$A$B</em> making use of the tangent.
: The correct answer is:  $AB    
: Calculate the length of a side , using the tangent.<br />Given:<ul><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/Delta.gif" alt="&delta;" />&nbsp; <em>$A$B$C</em><li><img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$A</em>=90<sup>o</sup><br /><li> <em>$A$B=$AB</em> and <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$C</em>=$hoek<sup>o</sup></ul><p />Calculate the length of side <em>$A$C</em> using the tangent.
: The correct answer is:  $AC
: Calculate the Sine of an angle.<br />Given:<ul><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/Delta.gif" alt="&delta;" />&nbsp; <em>$A$B$C</em><li> <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$A</em>=90<sup>o</sup><br /><li> <em>$A$B=$AB</em> and <em>$B$C=$BC</em></ul><p />Calculate the Sine of <img src="$module_dir/gifs/hoek.gif" alt="&ang;" />&nbsp;<em>$C</em>
